Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260811121008.1493015-3-heikki.krogerus@linux.intel.com
Signed-off-by: Rodrigo Vivi <rodrigo.vivi@intel.com>
(cherry picked from commit a55b76b8bc2c49b11d753c1c6d06ec3a2c61c85e)
